<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Potash cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Potash cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Wednesday it had cut its near-term rating on Potash Corp of Saskatchewan to neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage kept its long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares fell 1-7/8 to 84-1/2 at Wednesday's opening.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
